<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-341] sql-query-put and sql-query-put-offheap benchmarks don&apos;t work</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-341</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I have run sql-benchmarks in sprint-2 and in sql-tests branch.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;In sprint-2&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
All except sql-query-put-offheap work fine. Thread dumps and logs in attachment (&lt;b&gt;sp-2.zip&lt;/b&gt;) &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;In sql-tests-branch&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
sql-query-put:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
