&lt;p&gt;sql-query-put-offheap - doesn&apos;t work (thread dumps and logs in attachment - sql-test.zip)&lt;br/&gt;
Also during all benchmarks started only from 0 to 2 iterations.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;jdk 1.7.0_21&lt;br/&gt;
1 driver and 3 servers&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
